{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"どーもー♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近髪を切りました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2013/05/19/6760169/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"人生初のショートに近い\n短さですヽ(〃v〃)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あとで『嘘でした～』って\n書くと思ってるでしょ｀‐ω‐´)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"書きまへんで？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とかいいつつ..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"書きます..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いやいや！\nほんとだから書きません♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ん......んーとぉ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっぱりにそんな\n短さにはしてません！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"紛らわしい？（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(めんどくさい！！)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"誰だ！めんどくさいとか\n言ったのは！！(｡･`Д･´)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しいんですよぉ～♡\nやらせてやってください（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ショートに見えるように\n頑張って写メとったんですよ(-ω-ﾒ)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ということで本当は\n5cmくらいしか切ってません☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちゅんっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2013/05/19/6760169/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あぁ楽しかった♡←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これを電車でちょこっと\n微笑みながら書いてました_(┐「ε:)_"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも結構短くなったかもなぁ♪\n復帰当時くらいに戻しました(｡･ω･)ﾉﾞ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"結果、家に帰ってお母さんに\n『髪切ったの～♪♪』って言ったら\n『幼くなったね！(にっこり)』と\n言われたよヾ(-ω-*)☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さてさてこの前の乃木どこ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私はアントニオ猪木さんについて\n講師をさせていただいたんですが\nすごく楽しかった～♪♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かつて抱いていた先生に\nなりたいという夢がまさか\nあんなところで叶うとは(´°ω°｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いやいや、あんなんじゃ\n先生なんて務まりませんね(ﾟ-ﾟ；)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夢を変えて正解だったみたい(´-ω-｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして若月ブログにもありましたが\nこの前若月が誘ってくれて\n若月・玲香・真夏で\nご飯行ってきました～∩^ω^∩♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私この3人さんスキだよっ♡///"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またあっちこっち\n連れてってくださいませ(((っ･ω･)っ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よーし、じゃあまなったんと\nおしゃべりtime(｡･ω･)ﾉﾞ♡\n行きましょ～♪♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q真夏ってカラオケとかいくの？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A行くけど初めて行った相手とかだと照れちゃって自分からはあんまり歌いません（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"聴くのも好きなんだよね～♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Qまなったんのファンの人達をくくるいいかんじの呼び方か何か作ってくださいな♪(￣0￣)/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A今のところ作らない\nつもりなんです(｡･ω･)ﾉﾞ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして私はネーミングセンスが\nないの！！(-ω-；)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q真夏は身長もっとほしかった？それとももう少し低い方が良かった？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Aもうちょこっと欲しかったなぁ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと158cmが私がずーっと\n憧れてた身長なんだぁ(((っ･ω･)っ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q乃木どこでウインクが得意な秋元真夏です！って言ってたけど握手会でお願いしたらしてくれる？q(^-^q)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Aいいよー∩^ω^∩\nうまくできるか\nわからないけど（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもハイハイ固めは\nおあずけです(人-ω-)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Qまなったんの好きなキャラクターはなーに⁇♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A最近ベティーちゃんが好き☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Qまなったんは福岡に来たことありますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Aまさにこの前ご飯一緒に\n食べに行った若月・玲香・真夏で\n福岡にキャンペーンで\nいったよヽ(｡･ω･)ﾉﾞ☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その時初めて馬刺し食べたの♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほれっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2013/05/19/6760169/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっ！昨日のBADBOYS J\nナイツレディースも出ていました♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まさかの放送後の告知で\nごめんなさい(´°ω°｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じゃ、6thシングルの制作も\n頑張ってきまーす∩^ω^∩♡とぅっっ"}],"source":"archive"}